<title>LITHUANIA: BOURSE TRADING SUSPENSIONS.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TRADING SUSPENSIONS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's bourse said on Tuesday that its board had suspended trade in shares of Lithuanian Savings Bank from April 29 for three trading sessions because it is assimilating share issues.</p>
<p>The bourse also said in a statement that its board on Monday decided to renew trading in the shares of Lithuanian Energy from April 30. The company's shares were temporarily suspended while it reduced the number of shares in its issue.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
